<<wait_for_action open_aarav_stall>>
aarav: Bhai! Bhai! Look at this. AirPods. Original-original.
aarav: For you only — ₹3,000. Ekdum copy nahi hai, full original.
<<player_choose>>
-> Show me.
    aarav: See the box. See the "Apple" written. Pure.
    <<jump NeedsAndWants_Inspect>>
-> ₹3,000? Out of my Spend envelope?
    aarav: Arre, ₹3,000 is nothing for music quality like this.
    <<jump NeedsAndWants_Inspect>>
