title: NeedsAndWants_Inspect
tags:
---
<<wait_for_action inspect_airpod_box>>
aarav: Don't look so close. Just buy, na.
maya-didi: (whispers) Before you spend three thousand, do one thing.
maya-didi: Open your notebook. Two columns. Needs. Wants.
<<wait_for_action open_notebook>>
maya-didi: Drag every line from today into the correct column.
maya-didi: Rule of thumb — if you skip it, do you still survive the week?
<<jump NeedsAndWants_Sort>>
===

title: NeedsAndWants_Sort
tags:
---
<<wait_for_action drag_item rent needs>>
<<wait_for_action drag_item dabba_lunch needs>>
<<wait_for_action drag_item bus_pass needs>>
<<wait_for_action drag_item chai needs>>
<<wait_for_action drag_item airpod_copy wants>>
<<wait_for_action drag_item movie_ticket wants>>
maya-didi: Now look at the Wants column. Add it up.
maya-didi: ₹3,200 in one day of wants. Your whole Spend envelope is ₹8,200.
<<player_choose>>
-> Buy the AirPods anyway.
    aarav: Yes! Bhai is a king!
    <<wait_for_action hand_over_cash 3000>>
    maya-didi: Theek hai. Your choice. But watch the envelope.
    <<set_flag bought_fake_airpods>>
    <<jump NeedsAndWants_Aftermath>>
-> Walk away from the stall.
    aarav: Arre boss, kal phir milte hain. Kal discount!
    maya-didi: Achha. You looked at the column and decided. That is the skill.
    <<set_flag refused_fake_airpods>>
    <<jump NeedsAndWants_Aftermath>>
-> Negotiate to ₹500.
    aarav: ₹500?! Bhai, even the box costs ₹500.
    aarav: Okay, okay. Final ₹1,500. Last price. Pakka.
    <<player_choose>>
    -> Still no.
        <<set_flag refused_fake_airpods>>
        <<jump NeedsAndWants_Aftermath>>
    -> Done, ₹1,500.
        <<wait_for_action hand_over_cash 1500>>
        <<set_flag bought_fake_airpods>>
        <<jump NeedsAndWants_Aftermath>>
===

title: NeedsAndWants_Aftermath
tags:
---
maya-didi: Two columns. Every rupee. Every day.
maya-didi: Wants are not bad. Wants without a column are.
<<continue>>
<<grant_mastery budgeting.needs-wants 1>>
